Good point, and no. My proposal is to freeze wave planning until 17 Nov. Unti=
l then we release waves manually, with the same cut-off times as today (10:00=
 and 14:00).

The reason is the customs go-live. It changes the delivery block logic for ex=
port deliveries. If we change waves and customs checks at the same time and s=
omething breaks, we will not know which change caused it. So wave templates s=
tay as they are, and we change them only after 17 Nov.

Regards,
